    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d644">

                <pb facs="0997" n="1955" sameAs="frus:frus1888p2/pg1955"/>

                <head>No. 82.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Adee to Mr. Ibsen.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1888-06-09"><hi rendition="#italic">June</hi> 9,
                        1888</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: A copy of your note of the 21st ultimo,
                    asking, under the instruction of your Government, to be furnished with a list
                    specifying all dues of any kind levied on Swedish vessels in American ports,
                    and, second, the amount of such dues, was transmitted to the Treasury
                    Department, and I have now the honor to inclose a report from the Commissioner
                    of Navigation of that Department, giving the information desired.</p>
                <p>Accept, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Alvey A. Adee.</hi></signed></closer>




                <xi:include href="d644-a1.xml" xpointer="d644-a1"/>
